{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26969","headline":"酬薛奉礼见赠之作 · 姚合","name":"酬薛奉礼见赠之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖栖沧海一耕人，诏遣江边作使君。\n山顶雨余青到地，涛头风起白连云。\n诗成客见书墙和，药熟僧来就鼎分。\n珍重来章相借分，芳名未识已曾闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}